<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Email Verification</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .otp-code { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #2563eb; letter-spacing: 5px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Verify Your Email Address</h2>
    <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for registering with our Project Management SaaS. Please use the following OTP code to complete your registration:</p>
    
    <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
    
    <p>This code will expire in 5 minutes.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>